        "Should a Siesta Key deck be pavers or concrete after 2024?", "Pavers on a rebuildable base, in nearly every case. A poured deck that sat in surge with voids under it is replaced; a paver field is lifted, the base fixed and the same pavers reset. That's the difference between a claim and a weekend.",
