        "Can a Siesta Key deck that stood in surge be resurfaced?", "Only after sounding shows no voids and a level shows it didn't drop; then a fresh-water rinse, a dry month, and an overlay. If it sounds hollow anywhere, the base under it moved and the overlay would follow.",
